{"ID":"20240205153810-cv4kcq1","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153810-cv4kcq1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153810-cv4kcq1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101952-gjhei1o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221194519-gbse0e5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221194519-gbse0e5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"牵牛子","type":"doc","updated":"20240902103029"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206101952-gjhei1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101952-gjhei1o","updated":"20240206102001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产广西、云南等地。\n【性状】\t牵牛子呈三棱形，形似橘瓣状。表面灰黑色 (黑牵牛子) 或淡黄白色 (白牵牛子) 。种皮坚韧，背面有一纵沟。味辛苦，有麻舌感。\n【性味】\t苦，寒，有毒。\n【功效】\t泻水通便，消痰涤饮，杀虫攻积。用于水肿胀满，二便不通，痰饮积聚，气逆喘咳，虫积腹痛，蛔虫、绦虫病。\n【炙品】\t炒牵牛子：取净牵牛子，置预热炒制容器内，用文火加热，炒至有爆裂声，稍鼓起，颜色加深，微有香气，断面黄色，取出晾凉。用时捣碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240206101953-gc2t00s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101953-gc2t00s","updated":"20240206101953"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206101953-8fzq6tb.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205160756-9xbltva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205160756-9xbltva","updated":"20240205160756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牵牛子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牵牛子-20240205160756-kcag4dq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240221194519-gbse0e5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240221194519-gbse0e5","updated":"20240221194519"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 544px;","style":"width: 534px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240221194519-77e94f6.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 534px;\" parent-style=\"width: 544px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717101025-hjybei0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717101025-hjybei0","updated":"20240717101221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 608px;","style":"width: 598px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牵牛子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牵牛子-20240717101025-6iciixa.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 598px;\" parent-style=\"width: 608px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 664px;","style":"width: 654px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牵牛子 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牵牛子 4-20240717101221-pzp469g.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 654px;\" parent-style=\"width: 664px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717101039-f47kek5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717101039-f47kek5","updated":"20240717101256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 692px;","style":"width: 682px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牵牛子 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牵牛子 2-20240717101122-oxes119.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 682px;\" parent-style=\"width: 692px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 584px;","style":"width: 574px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牵牛子 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牵牛子 5-20240717101256-kyolr6u.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 574px;\" parent-style=\"width: 584px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717101125-91afhjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717101125-91afhjm","updated":"20240717101410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 569px;","style":"width: 559px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牵牛子 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牵牛子 1-20240717101039-enfftb4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 559px;\" parent-style=\"width: 569px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 678px;","style":"width: 668px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牵牛子 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牵牛子 6-20240717101410-eyt37rp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 668px;\" parent-style=\"width: 678px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717101530-rjsr7us","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717101530-rjsr7us","updated":"20240717101603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 677px;","style":"width: 667px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牵牛子 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牵牛子 8-20240717101530-o35zj03.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 667px;\" parent-style=\"width: 677px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 566px;","style":"width: 556px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牵牛子 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牵牛子 9-20240717101603-bc0pg8j.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 556px;\" parent-style=\"width: 566px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717101742-qcxr7rv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717101742-qcxr7rv","updated":"20240902103003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 401px;","style":"width: 391px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牵牛子 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牵牛子 12-20240717101742-8k75k6g.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 391px;\" parent-style=\"width: 401px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 791px;","style":"width: 781px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牵牛子 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牵牛子 13-20240717101804-vxln4ia.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 781px;\" parent-style=\"width: 791px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717101645-yq1uhqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717101645-yq1uhqe","updated":"20240717101701"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 623px;","style":"width: 613px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牵牛子 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牵牛子 11-20240717101701-1oo8gqa.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 613px;\" parent-style=\"width: 623px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 648px;","style":"width: 638px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牵牛子 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牵牛子 10-20240717101645-ts1pvj3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 638px;\" parent-style=\"width: 648px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717101838-sc1f89u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717101838-sc1f89u","updated":"20240717101913"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牵牛子 (14)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牵牛子 14-20240717101838-9unognh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 510px;","style":"width: 500px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"牵牛子 (15)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/牵牛子 15-20240717101913-5d3gbma.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 500px;\" parent-style=\"width: 510px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717101922-nmfrvx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717101922-nmfrvx3","updated":"20240902103029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：牵牛花开了花以后，结的子就是牵牛子；牵牛的牛=丑（十二生肖，子鼠丑牛...），故牵牛子又叫黑丑又叫白丑；"}]},{"ID":"20240717101814-yod19d3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240717101814-yod19d3"}},{"ID":"20240902102902-c10pt2m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-c10pt2m","updated":"20240902102914"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：牵牛子"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-e06wkg5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-e06wkg5","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牵牛子《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-467x6n1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-467x6n1","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】QiānNiúZǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-iqvc2ki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-iqvc2ki","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】SEMENPHARBITIDIS"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-2zbpa6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-2zbpa6i","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】牵牛、黑丑、白丑、二丑、喇叭花子"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-jnanksw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-jnanksw","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为旋花科植物裂叶牵牛Pharbitisnil（L.）Choisy或圆叶牵牛Pharbitispurpurea（L.）Voigt的干燥成熟种子。秋末果实成熟、果壳未开裂时采割植株，晒干，打下种子，除去杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-gl1tmz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-gl1tmz6","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品似橘瓣状，长4～8mm，宽3～5mm。表面灰黑色或淡黄白色，背面有一条浅纵沟，腹面棱线的下端有一点状种脐，微凹。质硬，横切面可见淡黄色或黄绿色皱缩折叠的子叶，微显油性。无臭，味辛、苦，有麻感。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-fbfioqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-fbfioqu","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-9q4910f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-9q4910f","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）取本品，加水浸泡后种皮呈龟裂状，手捻有明显的黏滑感。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-qutufri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-qutufri","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）本品粉末淡黄棕色。种皮表皮细胞深棕色，形状不规则，壁微波状。非腺毛单细胞，黄棕色，稍弯曲，长50～240μm。子叶碎片中有分泌腔，圆形或椭圆形，直径35～106μm。草酸钙簇晶直径10～25μm。栅状组织碎片及光辉带有时可见。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-fv74bfn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-fv74bfn","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）取本品1g，研碎，加2mol/L盐酸乙醇溶液30ml，加热回流1。5小时，滤过，滤液加水40ml，置水浴上蒸至无醇味，水溶液置分液漏斗中，加苯30ml振摇提取，分取苯层，回收溶剂，残渣加无水乙醇1ml使溶解，作为供试品溶液。另取牵牛子对照药材1g，同法制成对照药材溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录ⅥB）试验，吸取上述两种溶液各4μl，分别点于同一硅胶G薄层板上，以环已烷-醋酸乙酯（9：1）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，喷以5％香草醛硫酸溶液，在105℃加热至斑点显色清晰。供试品色谱中，在与对照药材色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-wz4k58b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-wz4k58b","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-mokclx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-mokclx8","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牵牛子：除去杂质。用时捣碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-bbrqjxw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-bbrqjxw","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炒牵牛子：取净牵牛子，照清炒法（附录ⅡD）炒至稍鼓起。用时捣碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-8rq72qs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-8rq72qs","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】苦、寒；有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-m2d2ofl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-m2d2ofl","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肺、肾、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-a2ny20w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-a2ny20w","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】泻水通便，消痰涤饮，杀虫攻积。用于水肿胀满，二便不通，痰饮积聚，气逆喘咳，虫积腹痛，蛔虫、绦虫病。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-734jmzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-734jmzt","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】3～6g。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-h9f7w2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-h9f7w2z","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】孕妇禁用，不宜与巴豆、巴豆霜同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-msfivyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-msfivyl","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-j1fyhmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-j1fyhmb","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-iqycm2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-iqycm2x","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）用于腹水肿胀，可配合攻下逐水药如甘遂、芫花、大戟等同用。用于痰壅气滞、咳逆喘满，常与葶苈子、杏仁等配合应用。用于虫积腹痛，常配伍槟榔、大黄等同用，对蛔虫、绦虫都有驱杀作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-wgzlkt2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-wgzlkt2","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）牵牛子为峻下的药品，少用则通大便，多用则泻下如水，且能利尿，故在临床上主要用于腹水肿胀、二便不利及宿食积滞、大便秘结等症。至于用治痰壅气滞、咳逆喘满，则只宜暂用，不可久服。如属脾弱胃呆、气虚腹胀者，当以健脾补中为要，不宜用本品攻泻消积，克伐胃气。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-2hluu9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-2hluu9a","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-l3stpdf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-l3stpdf","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牵牛子《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-yn0uehw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-yn0uehw","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《雷公炮炙论》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-y7y22mn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-y7y22mn","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】QiānNiúZǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-aok2px4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-aok2px4","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】草金铃（《雷公炮炙论》），金铃（《本草图经》），黑牵牛、白牵牛（《仁斋直指方》），黑丑、白丑（《纲目》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-yxivuou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-yxivuou","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为旋花科植物牵牛或毛牵牛等的种子。7～10月间果实成熟时，将藤割下，打出种子，除去果壳杂质，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-6fsocoj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-6fsocoj","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-03hsg9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-03hsg9u","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①牵牛（《雷公炮炙论》），又名:盆甑草（《酉阳杂俎》），狗耳草（《纲目》），牵牛花（《花镜》），勤娘子、姜花（《植物名实图考》），裂叶牵牛、打碗花、江良种、常春藤叶牵牛、喇叭花。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-3e91ejl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-3e91ejl","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一年生攀援草本。茎缠绕，多分枝。叶互生，心脏形，3裂至中部，中间裂片卵圆形，先端短渐尖，两侧裂片斜卵形，全缘，两面均被毛；叶柄较花梗为长。花2～3朵腋生，具总梗；小花梗长约1厘米，具2细长苞片；萼5深裂，裂片狭披针形，长2～3厘米，先端长尖，基部被硬毛；花冠漏斗状，先端5浅裂，紫色或淡红色，上部色较深，下部色浅或为白色；雄蕊5，生于花冠近基部，花药长圆形；子房圆形，3室，花柱长于雄蕊，柱头头状。蒴果球形，种子5～6枚，黑褐色或白色、浅黄色，无毛。花期6～9月。果期7～9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-invdbz6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-invdbz6","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于山野、田野，或墙脚下、路旁，也有栽培。全国各地均有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-grv8kv0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-grv8kv0","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②毛牵牛，又名:圆叶牵牛、紫花牵牛。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-7lnvjcu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-7lnvjcu","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一年生攀援摹本，全体具白色长毛。叶阔心脏形，长7～12厘米，宽7～13厘米，先端短尖，基部心形，全缘。花1～5朵成簇腋生，花梗多巧叶柄等长；花萼裂片卵状披针形，长约1.5厘米，基部皆被伏刺毛；花冠漏斗状，通常为蓝紫色、粉红或白色。蒴果球形，种子黑色或黄白色，无毛。花期7～8月。果期9～10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-t8pqoyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-t8pqoyl","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多生子路旁、田间、墙脚下，或灌丛中。全国大部分地区有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-djmlzy7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-djmlzy7","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】全国大部分地区均产。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-hwm3l2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-hwm3l2t","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-buyppmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-buyppmz","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"干燥成熟的种子，卵形而具三棱，两侧面稍平坦，背面弓状隆起，其正中有纵宜凹沟，两侧凸起部凹凸不平。腹面为一棱线，棱线下端有类圆形浅色的肿脐，种子长4～8毫米，背面及平坦面宽3～5毫米。表面灰黑色（黑丑），或淡黄白色（白丑）。种皮坚硬。横切面可见极为皱缩而重叠的二片子叶。呈黄色或淡黄色。用水浸润后，种皮作龟裂状，并自腹面棱线处破裂，有显着粘液性。气无，味微辛辣。有麻辣感，并有豆样味。以成熟、饱满、无皮壳杂质、无黑白相杂者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-uklpg9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-uklpg9n","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品有黑、白二种，黑者名黑丑，白者名白丑，两种的混合品名二丑。一般花色较深，呈紫红等色者，其种子多黑，花色较浅，呈白色、粉红等色者，其种子多白。种子的颜色与植物的品种无关。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-mjaijrc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-mjaijrc","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-8iv8u0m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-8iv8u0m","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牵牛种子含牵牛子甙、牵牛子酸甲及没食子酸。牵牛子甙为一混合物，是羟基脂肪酸的各种有机酸酯的糖甙，经皂化所得的牵牛子酸是至少含有4种化合物的混合物，其中2种已被提纯，经酸水解可得牵牛子酸乙、葡萄糖及鼠李糖。另含生物碱麦角醇、裸麦角碱、喷尼棒麦角碱、异喷尼棒麦角碱和野麦碱。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-tocofou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-tocofou","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"未成热种子含赤霉素A20、赤霉素A3、赤霉素A5。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-og4qidc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-og4qidc","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-kekefbw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-kekefbw","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牵牛子甙的化学性质与泻根素相似，有强烈的泻下作用。牵牛子甙在肠内遇胆汁及肠液分解出牵牛子素，刺激肠道，增进蠕动，导致泻下。据动物试验，黑丑与白丑泻下作用并无区别。关于牵牛子的泻下作用原理，研究很少，它与硫酸镁、大黄不同，在泻下时，不引起血糖的剧烈变化，但能加速菊糖在肾脏中之排出，可能有利尿作用。牵牛子的水、醇浸剂对小鼠皆有泻下作用，但经煎煮后，即失去作用。除去牵牛子甙后的水溶液，似仍有泻下作用，故除已知的牵牛子甙外，可能还含有其他泻下成分。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-czunjc2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-czunjc2","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在体外试验，黑丑、白丑对猪蛔尚有某些驱虫效果。牵牛子甙似能兴奋离体兔肠及离体大鼠子宫；静脉注射1毫克/公斤对麻醉犬、兔的血压、呼吸无明显影响。对小鼠皮下注射之半数致死量为37.5毫克/公斤。对人有毒性，但不大，大量除对胃肠的直接刺激引起呕吐、腹痛、腹泻与粘液血便外，还可能刺激肾脏，引起血尿，重者尚可损及神经系统，发生语言障碍、昏迷等。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-5vsivm3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-5vsivm3","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三色牵牛含异麦角酰胺、麦角酰胺及裸麦角碱，有致幻作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-q7myci5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-q7myci5","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-mbaiglm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-mbaiglm","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炒牵牛子:将净牵牛子置锅内加热，炒至微鼓起，取出放凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-8vszxai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-8vszxai","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮炙论》:\"凡使牵牛子，入水中淘，取沉者晒干，拌酒蒸，从巳至未，晒干，临用春去黑皮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-tzk0wov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-tzk0wov","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》:\"牵牛子，今多只碾取头末，去皮麸不用，亦有半生半熟用者。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-ktei32b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-ktei32b","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-frv0cpc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-frv0cpc","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦辛，寒，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-dtufru4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-dtufru4","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》:\"苦，寒，有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-11hho70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-11hho70","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药性沦》:\"味甘，有小毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-glk1ad4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-glk1ad4","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《日华子本草》:\"味苦莶。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-xobho7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-xobho7x","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-2uoyvuz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-2uoyvuz","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入肺，肾，大、小肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-ukevvm4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-ukevvm4","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目》:\"走气分，通三焦，达右肾命门。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-afi13fd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-afi13fd","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《雷公炮制药性解》:\"入大、小肠二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-krlbia2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-krlbia2","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草通玄》:\"入肺，大、小肠。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-qpubcck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-qpubcck","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草新编》:\"入脾与大、小肠，兼通膀胱。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-e49r51n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-e49r51n","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-cwkou6v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-cwkou6v","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泻水，下气，杀虫。治水肿，喘满。痰饮，脚气，虫积食滞，大便秘结。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-vxeyxp0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-vxeyxp0","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《别录》:\"主下气，疗脚满水肿，除风毒，利小便。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-upj4g13","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-upj4g13","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药性论》:\"治痃癖气块，利大小便，除水气，虚肿。落胎。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-rynw98o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-rynw98o","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《日华子本草》:\"取腰痛，下冷脓，并一切气壅滞。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-frn0e2z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-frn0e2z","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④李杲:\"除气分湿热，三焦塑结。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-idtg8n7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-idtg8n7","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《纲目》:\"逐痰消饮，通大肠气秘风秘，杀虫。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-mpddnkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-mpddnkd","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《江苏植药志》:\"适用于急性关节炎。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-z8zralk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-z8zralk","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《新疆中草药手册》:\"泻下，利尿，杀虫。治便秘，消化不良，肾炎水肿，小儿咽喉炎。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-8g45oz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-8g45oz2","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服:入丸、散，1～3分；煎汤，1.5～3钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-sz9l57o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-sz9l57o","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-hhskltn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-hhskltn","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孕妇及胃弱气虚者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-dhsedg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-dhsedg1","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《日华子本草》:\"得青木香、干姜良。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-fn622tl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-fn622tl","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草衍义补遗》:\"不胀满，不大便秘者勿用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-d9lwiai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-d9lwiai","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《品汇精要》:\"妊娠不可服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-luw89fj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-luw89fj","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草备要》:\"若湿热在血分，胃弱气虚人禁用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-1xq81m9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-1xq81m9","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-cq904wu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-cq904wu","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治水肿:牵牛子末之，水服方寸匕，日一，以小便利为度。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-x7nunpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-x7nunpn","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治停饮肿满:黑牵牛头末四两，茴香一两（炒），或加木香一胡。上为细末，以生姜自然汁调一、二钱，临卧服。（《儒门事亲》禹功散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-6oyw6ix","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-6oyw6ix","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治水气蛊胀满:白牵牛、黑牵牛各二钱。上为末，和大麦面四两，为烧饼，临卧用茶汤一杯下，降气为验。（《宣明论方》一气散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-42acazo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-42acazo","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治小儿腹胀，水气流肿，膀胱实热，小便赤涩:牵牛生研一钱。青皮汤空心下。一加木香减半，丸服。（《郑氏小儿方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-ytwrhrx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-ytwrhrx","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治四肢肿满:厚朴（去皮，姜汁制炒）半两，牵牛子五两（炒取末二两）。上细末。每服二钱，煎姜、枣汤调下。（《本事方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-3nsu56y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-3nsu56y","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治小儿肺胀喘满，胸高气急，两肋扇动，陷下作坑，两鼻窍张，闷乱嗽渴，声嗄不鸣，痰涎潮塞，俗云马脾风:白牵牛一两（半生半熟），黑牵牛，-两（半生半熟），川大黄、槟榔各一两。上为细末。三岁儿每服二钱，冷浆水调下，涎多加腻粉少许，无时，加蜜少许。（田氏《保婴集》牛黄夺命散）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-dvh8zd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-dvh8zd2","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治脚气胫已满，捏之没指者:牵牛子，捣，蜜丸，如小豆大五丸，吞之。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-82heblw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-82heblw","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治一切虫积:牵牛子二两（炒，研为束），槟榔一两，使君子肉五十个（微炒）。俱为末。每服二钱。沙糖调下，小儿减半。（《永类铃方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-t7tq86d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-t7tq86d","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治大肠风秘壅热结涩:牵牛子（黑色，微炒，捣取其中粉）一两，桃仁（末）半两。以熟蜜和丸如梧桐子。温水服三、二十丸。（《本草衍义》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-kyi6sle","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-kyi6sle","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治冷气流注，腰疼不能俯仰:延胡索二两，破故纸（炒）二两，黑牵牛子三两（炒）。上为细末，煅大蒜研搜丸，如梧桐子大。每服三十丸，煎葱须盐汤送下，食前服。（《杨氏家藏方》牵牛丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-63xd4db","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-63xd4db","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治肾气作痛:黑、白牵牛等分。炒为末，每服三钱，用猪腰子切，入茴香百粒，川椒五十粒，掺牵牛末入内扎定，纸包煨熟，空心食之。酒下，取出恶物效。（《仁斋直指方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-6b68rug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-6b68rug","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治肠痈有脓，胀闭不出:牵牛子头末三钱，大黄二钱，穿山甲（煅）二钱，乳香、汉药各一钱。俱为末。每服三钱，白汤调服。（《张三丰仙传方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-w7cwkyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-w7cwkyp","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治梅毒，横痃:白牵牛仁，每次五、六钱，煎汤内服。（《泉州本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-d7leu1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-d7leu1g","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治风热赤眼:黑丑仁为末，调葱白汤敷患处。（《泉州本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-8l961s1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-8l961s1","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-2uzxudk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-2uzxudk","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①李杲:\"牵牛子，……《本草》名医续注云，味苦寒能除湿，利小水，治下疰脚气。据所说，气味主治俱误矣。何以明之?凡药中用牵牛者，少则动大便，多则下水，此乃泻气之药，试取尝之，即得辛辣之味，久而嚼之，猛烈雄壮，渐渐不绝，非辛如何?续注家乃谓味苦寒，其苦寒果安在哉?若以为泻湿之药，犹不知其的也。何则?此物但能泻气中之湿热，不能泻血中之湿热。夫湿者水之别称，有形者也，若肺先受湿，则宜用之。今用药者不问有湿无湿，但伤食，或欲动大便，或有热服，或作常服，克化之药俱用牵牛，岂不悮哉?殊不知牵牛辛烈，泻人元气，比诸辛药泻气尤甚，以其辛之雄烈故也。今重为备言之，若病湿胜，湿气不得施化，致大小便不通，则宜用之耳，湿去则气得周流，所谓五脏有邪，更相平也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-742ntny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-742ntny","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《汤液本草》:\"牵牛，以气药引则入气，以大黄引则入血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-2ftg401","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-2ftg401","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《纲目》:\"牵牛，自宋以后，北人常用取快，及刘守真、张子和出，又倡为通用下药，牵明之目击其事，故著其说极力闢之。牵牛治水气在肺，喘满肿胀，下焦郁遏，腰背胀肿，及大肠风秘气秘，卓有殊功。但病在血分及脾胃虚弱而痞满者，则不可取快一时及常服，暗伤元气也。一宗室夫人，年几六十，平生苦肠结病，旬日一行，甚于生产，服养血润燥药刚泥膈不快，服硝、黄通利药则若罔知，如此三十余年矣，时珍诊其人体肥，膏粱而多忧郁，日吐酸痰碗许乃宽，又多火病，此乃三焦之气壅滞，有升无降，津液皆化为痰饮，不能下滋肠腑，非血燥比也。润剂留滞，硝、黄徒入血分，不能通气，俱为痰阻，故无效也。乃用牵牛末，皂荚膏丸与服，即便通利，自是但觉肠结，一服就顺，亦不妨食，且复精爽。盖牵牛能走气分，通三焦，气顺则痰逐饮消，上下通快矣。外甥柳乔，素多酒色，病下极胀痛，二便不通，不能坐卧，立哭呻吟者七昼夜。医用通利药不效，遣人叩予，予思此乃湿热之邪在精道，壅胀隧路，病在二阴之间，故前阻小便，后阻大便，病不在大肠、膀胱也。乃用楝实、茴香、穿山甲诸药，入牵牛加倍，水煎服，一服而减，三服而平。牵牛能达右肾命门，走精隧，人所不知，惟东垣李明之知之，故明之治下焦阳虚，天真丹用牵牛以盐水炒黑，入佐沉香、杜仲、破故纸、官桂诸药，深得补泻兼施之妙，方见《医学发明》。又东垣治脾湿太过，通身浮肿，喘不得卧，腹如鼓，海金沙散，亦以牵牛为君，则东垣未尽弃牵牛不用，但贵施之得道耳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-rfwgopt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-rfwgopt","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草正》:\"牵牛，古方多为散、丸，若用救急，亦可佐群药煎服，然大泄元气，凡虚弱之人须忌之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-lpez48s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-lpez48s","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草正义》；\"牵牛，善泄湿热，通利水道，亦走大便，故《别录》谓其苦寒，至李氏东垣，以其兼有辛莶气味，遂谓是辛热雄烈。按，此物甚滑，通泄是其专长，试细嚼之，惟其皮稍有辛味，古今主治，皆用之于湿热气滞，实肿胀满，二便不通，则东垣以为辛热，张石顽和之，亦谓辛温，皆属不确，当以《别录》之苦寒为正。又莶气戟人喉舌，细味之亦在皮中，所谓有毒，盖即在此。古方中凡用末子，均称止用头末，正以其皮粘韧，不易细碎，只用头末，则弃其皮，而可无辛莶之毒，颇有意味可思。观《别录》主治专破气分之壅滞，泄水湿之肿满，除风利便，固皆以实病言之，此药功用，固已包举无遗。甄权申之，则曰治痃癖气块，利大小便，东垣谓除气分湿热，三焦壅结；濒湖谓逐痰饮，通大肠气秘、风秘、杀虫。亦皆主结滞壅塞立论。而甄权乃又谓除虚肿，则误矣。《日华本草》谓治腰痛，盖亦指湿热阻塞，腰脊不利之症，惟言之殊不分明，究属非是。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-v9xfhr3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-v9xfhr3","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-8lkfyr2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-8lkfyr2","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牵牛子《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-uii84ug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-uii84ug","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《雷公炮炙论》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-wpytm64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-wpytm64","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】QiānNiúZǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-8lm5zma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-8lm5zma","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】PharbitisSeed"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-5ebago3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-5ebago3","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】草金铃、金铃、黑牵牛、白牵牛、黑丑、白丑、丑牛子、二丑"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-cbqoz16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-cbqoz16","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-lf9oqsr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-lf9oqsr","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为双子叶植物药旋花科植物牵牛或毛牵牛等的种子。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-41hspwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-41hspwn","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Pharbitis(L.)Choisy.2.Pharbitispurpurea(L.)Voigt"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-r755a6z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-r755a6z","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋季果实成熟未开裂时将藤割下，晒干，种子自然脱落，除去果壳杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-pzqb3er","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-pzqb3er","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-00o54bw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-00o54bw","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.牵牛，一年生攀援草本。茎缠绕，长2m能上能下，被倒向的短柔毛及杂有倒向或开展的长硬毛。叶互生；叶柄长2-15cm；叶片宽卵形中近圆形，深或浅3裂，偶有5裂，长4-15cm，宽.5-14cm，基部心形，中裂片长圆形或卵圆形，渐尖或骤尖，侧裂片较短，三角形，裂口锐或圆，叶裂片长圆形或卵圆形，渐尖或柔尖，侧裂片较短，三角形，裂口锐或圆，叶面被微硬的柔毛。花腋生，单一或2-3朵着生于花序梗顶端，花序梗长短不一，被毛；苞片2，线形或叶状；萼片5，近等长，狭披针形，外面有毛；花冠漏斗状，长5-10cm，蓝紫色或紫红色，花冠管色淡；雄蕊5，不伸出花冠外，花丝不等长，基部稍阔，有毛；雌蕊1，子房无毛，3室，柱头头状。蒴果近球形，直径0.8-1.3cm，3瓣裂。种子5-6颗，卵状三棱形，黑褐色或米黄色。花期7-9月，果期8-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-bz44abh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-bz44abh","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.形态与牵牛相似，主要区别点是：叶片圆心形或宽卵状心形，长4-18cm，宽3.5cm，通常全缘。花腋生，单一或2-5朵成伞形聚伞花序，萼片卵状披针形。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-nhc87h1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-nhc87h1","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-i9k6qhw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-i9k6qhw","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：1.原产美洲，我国各地常见栽培，也常逸为野生。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-5fmqdyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-5fmqdyo","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.生于平地以至海拔2800m的田边、路旁、宅旁或山谷林内，栽培或野生。我国大部分地区有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-1u6b2m4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-1u6b2m4","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：牵牛全国各地均有分布。圆牵牛全国大部分地区有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-k8y3z5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-k8y3z5c","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-ofxolfu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-ofxolfu","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.气候土壤：牵牛适应性较强，对气候土壤要求不严，但以温和的气候和中等肥沃的砂质壤土为宜。过于低湿或干燥瘦嵴之地，生长均不良。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-rhtqw5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-rhtqw5o","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2．种植：以种子繁殖，于4-5月播种。播种前翻土作畦(如利用篱边、墙边、田埂等地种植，则不需作畦)，畦宽约1.3m，按株距23-33cm、行距30-50cm开穴，每穴播种子4-5粒。播后覆细土一层，以种子不露出为宜。种子发芽后，幼苗生长真叶2-3片时，便须间苗、补苗，亦可进行移植。以每穴保留2-3株即可。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-zaojkb5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-zaojkb5","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3．在藤蔓尚短时，可以进行松土除草1-2次。至藤蔓较长时，须设立支柱，或间种玉米、高梁等作物使其攀援其上，以代支柱。施肥，在前期施以人粪尿、硫酸氨等氮肥为宜，后期多施草木灰、骨粉等磷钾肥为宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-739xdf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-739xdf8","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-y30fujn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-y30fujn","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别种子似桔瓣状，略具3棱，长5-7mm，宽3-5mm。表面灰黑色（黑丑），或淡黄白色（白丑），背面弓状隆起，两侧面稍平坦，略具皱纹，背面正中有一条浅纵沟，腹面棱线下端为类圆形浅色种脐。质坚硬，横切面可见淡黄色或黄绿色皱缩折叠的子叶2片。水浸后种皮呈龟裂状，有明显粘液，气微味辛、苦、有麻舌感。以颗粒饱满、无果皮等杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-uprg9am","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-uprg9am","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别种子横切面：表皮细胞1列，略呈切向延长，有的含棕色物，间有分化成单细胞的非腺毛表皮下方为1列扁小的下皮细胞。栅状细胞层由2-3列细胞组成，靠外缘有一光辉带。营养层由数列切向延长的细胞及颓废细胞组成，有细小维管束，薄壁细胞中含细小淀粉粒。内胚乳最外1-2列细胞类方形，壁稍厚，内侧细胞的壁粘液化。子叶落归根薄壁组织中散有多数圆形的分泌腔，直径约至108μm；薄壁细胞中充满糊粉粒及脂肪油滴，并含草酸钙簇晶；直径约18μm。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-vziyje0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-vziyje0","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-6o8gjvn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-6o8gjvn","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.牵牛种子含牵牛子甙(pharbitin)约3%，系树脂性甙，用碱水解得到牵牛子酸(pharbiticacid)，巴豆酸(tiglicacid)，裂叶牵牛子酸(nilicacid)，α-甲基丁酸(α-methylbutyricacid)及戊酸(valericacid)等。牵牛子酸为混合物，分离得到牵牛子酸A、B、C、D，以后二者为主；牵牛子酸C系由番红醇酸(ipurolicacid)与2分子D-葡萄糖(D-glucose)缩合而成的甙，牵牛子酸D比牵牛子酸C多含1分子鼠李糖。种子还含生物碱；裸麦角碱(chanoclavine)，野麦碱(elymoclavine)，狼尾草麦角碱(penniclavine)，田麦角碱(agroclavine)，麦角醇(lyser-gol)等。又含脂肪油11%及其他糖类。未成熟种子含多种赤霉素及其葡萄糖甙：赤霉素(gib-berellin)A3、A5、A20、A26、A27；赤霉素葡萄糖甙(gibberellinglucoside)Ⅰ、Ⅱ、Ⅳ、Ⅴ、Ⅵ、Ⅶ、F-Ⅶ。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-chd61mm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-chd61mm","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.圆叶牵牛种子含赤霉素A3、A5、A8、A17、A19、A20、A26、A27、A29、A33、A44、A55。又含圣苯素-7-O-β-D-吡喃木糖基-O-β-D-吡喃阿拉伯糖甙(eriodictyol-7-O-β-D-xylopyanosyl-O-β-D-arabinopyranoside)，2-羟基-1，4-戊二酮(2-hydro-xy-1-phenyl-1,4-pentadione)，2，3，22，23-四羟基胆甾-6-酮(brassinone)，栗木甾酮(castasterone)和麦角类生物碱(ergotalkaloid)。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-4m0q2i2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-4m0q2i2","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】牵牛子甙的化学性质与泻根素(Jalapin)相似，有强烈的泻下作用。牵牛子甙在肠内遇胆汁及肠液分解出牵牛子素，刺激肠道，增进蠕动，导致泻下。据动物试验，黑丑与白丑泻下作用并无区别。关于牵牛子的泻下作用原理，研究很少，它与硫酸镁、大黄不同，在泻下时，不引起血糖的剧烈变化，但能加速菊糖(Inulin)在肾脏中之排出，可能有利尿作用。牵牛子的水、醇浸剂对小鼠皆有泻下作用，但经煎煮后，即失去作用。除去牵牛子甙后的水溶液，似仍有泻下作用，故除已知的牵牛子甙外，可能还含有其他泻下成分。在体外试验，黑丑、白丑对猪蛔尚有某些驱虫效果。牵牛子甙似能兴奋离体兔肠及离体大鼠子宫；静脉注射1mg/kg对麻醉犬、兔的血压、呼吸无明显影响。对小鼠皮下注射之半数致死量为37；5mg/kg。对人有毒性，但不大，大量除对胃肠的直接刺激引起呕吐、腹痛、腹泻与粘液血便外，还可能刺激肾脏，引起血尿，重者尚可损及神经系统，发生语言障碍、昏迷等。三色牵牛(Ipomoeatricolor)含异麦角酰胺(Isolyserga-nide)、麦角酰胺(Lysergamide)及裸麦角碱，有致幻作用。致泻：种子乙醇或水浸出液1.5-3g/kg灌胃，对小鼠有泻下作用，但煎剂则失去致泻能力。兴奋平滑肌：所含树脂0.2%浓度，对家兔离体肠管及子宫均有兴奋作用；皮下注射小鼠的半数致死量为37.5mg/kg。牵牛子甙水解产物的盐，可使豚鼠小肠、盲肠、大肠收缩，而牵牛子甙本身无此作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-16s3vjn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-16s3vjn","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【毒性】厚朴煎剂小鼠腹腔注射的半数致死量为6.12±0.038g/kg。木兰箭毒碱小鼠腹腔注射的半数致死量为45.55mg/kg。厚朴煎剂给猫静脉注射的最小致死量为4.25±1.25g/kg。厚朴煎剂给小鼠一次灌胃60g/kg，观察3天，未见死亡。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-rhy4wx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-rhy4wx5","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】理化鉴别（1）取本品粗粉2g，加石油醚20ml，浸泡2-4h，滤过。滤渣加甲醇20ml，冷浸4h，滤过。取滤液3ml，置蒸发皿内蒸干，加浓硫酸1滴，于水浴上加热，残渣呈红色至紫红色。（检查牵牛子甙）（2）用毛细管将上述甲醇提取液滴在滤纸上，一再滴加5%磷钼酸试液，于120℃烘烤2min，则显蓝至蓝黑色斑点。（检查牵牛子甙）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-o6cnc9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-o6cnc9m","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-rn10399","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-rn10399","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炒牵牛子：将净牵牛子置锅内加热，炒至微鼓起，取出放凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-4sqww46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-4sqww46","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《雷公炮炙论》：凡使牵牛子，入水中淘，取沉者晒干，拌酒蒸，从已至未，晒干，临用青去黑皮。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-szjo942","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-szjo942","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《纲目》：牵牛子，今多只碾取头末，去皮麸不用，亦有半生半熟用者。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-ljka4ah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-ljka4ah","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】苦辛；寒"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-kt5w4g0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-kt5w4g0","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肺；肾；大肠；小肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-33f8xz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-33f8xz2","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】利水通便；祛痰逐饮；消积杀虫。主水肿；腹水；脚气；痰壅喘咳；大便秘结；食滞虫积；腰痛；阴囊肿胀；痈疽肿毒；痔漏便毒等"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-qkjhwpz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-qkjhwpz","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3-10g。丸、散，每次0.3-1g，每日2-3次。炒用药性较缓。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-wvgupir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-wvgupir","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-zh67yw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-zh67yw1","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孕妇及胃弱气虚者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-ab2u1ul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-ab2u1ul","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《日华子本草》：得青木香、干姜良。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-v3z9z1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-v3z9z1n","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草衍义补遗》：不胀满，不大便秘者勿用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-jwt7ctf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-jwt7ctf","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《品汇精要》：妊娠不可服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-jsm9up4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-jsm9up4","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草备要》：若湿热在血分，胃弱气虚人禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-7mp7jxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-7mp7jxo","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】①治水肿：牵牛子末之，水服方寸匕，日一，以小便利为度。(《千金方》)②治停饮肿满：黑牵牛头末四两，茴香一两(炒)，或加木香一两。上为细末，以生姜自然汁调一、二钱，临卧服。(《儒门事亲》禹功散)③治水气蛊胀满：白牵牛、黑牵牛各二钱。上为末，和大麦面四两，为烧饼，临卧用茶汤一杯下，降气为验。(《宣明论方》一气散)④治小儿腹胀，水气流肿，膀胱实热，小便赤涩：牵牛生研一钱，青皮汤空心下。一加木香减半，丸服。(《郑氏小儿方》)⑤治四肢肿满：厚朴(去皮，姜汁制炒)半两，牵牛子五两(炒取末二两)。上细末。每服二钱，煎姜、枣汤调下。(《本事方》)⑥治小儿肺胀喘满，胸高气急，两肋扇动，陷下作坑，两鼻窍张，闷乱嗽渴，声嘎不鸣，痰涎潮塞，俗云马脾风：白牵牛一两(半生半熟)，黑牵牛一两(半生半熟)，川大黄、槟榔各一两。上为细末。三岁儿每服二钱，冷浆水调下，涎多加腻粉少许，无时，加蜜少许。(田氏《保婴集》牛黄夺命散)⑦治脚气胫已满，捏之没指者：牵牛子，捣，蜜丸，如小豆大五丸，吞之。(《补缺肘后方》)⑧治一切虫积：牵牛子二两(炒，研为末)，槟榔一两，使君子肉五十个(微炒)。俱为末。每服二钱，沙糖调下，小儿减半。(《永类钤方》)⑨治大肠风秘壅热结涩：牵牛子(黑色，微炒，捣取其中粉)一两，桃仁(末)半两，以熟蜜和丸如梧桐子。温水服三、二十丸。(《本草衍义》)⑩治冷气流注，腰疼不能俯仰：延胡索二两，破故纸(炒)二两，黑牵牛子三两(炒)。上为细末，煨大蒜研搜丸，如梧桐子大。每服三十丸，煎葱须盐汤送下，食前服。(《杨氏家藏方》牵牛丸)11.治肾气作痛：黑、白牵牛等分。炒为末，每服三钱，用猪腰子切，入茴香百粒，川椒五十粒，掺牵牛末入内扎定，纸包煨熟，空心食之，酒下，取出恶物效。(《仁斋直指方》)12.治肠痈有脓，胀闭不出：牵牛子头末三钱，大黄二钱，穿山甲(煅)二钱，乳香、没药各一钱。俱为末。每服三钱，白汤调服。(《张三丰仙传方》)13.治梅毒，横痃：白牵牛仁，每次五、六钱，煎汤内服。(《泉州本草》)14.治风热赤眼：黑丑仁为末，调葱白汤敷患处。(《泉州本草》)"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-qzb95lh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-qzb95lh","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-6gagktw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-6gagktw","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.李杲：牵牛子，《本草》名医续注云，味苦寒能除湿，利小水，治下疰脚气。据所说，气味主治俱误矣，何以明之？凡药中用牵牛者，少则动大便，多则下水，此乃泻气之药，试取尝之，即得辛辣之味，久而嚼之，猛烈雄壮，渐渐不绝，非辛如何？续注家乃谓味苦寒，其苦寒果安在哉？若以为泻湿之药，犹不知其的也。何则？此物但能泻气中之湿热，不能泻血中之湿热。夫湿者水之别称，有形者也，若肺先受湿，则宜用之。今用药者不问有湿无湿，但伤食，或欲动大便，或有热服，或作常服，克化之药俱用牵牛，岂不误哉？殊不知牵牛辛烈，泻人元气，比诸辛药泻气尤甚，以其辛之雄烈故也。今重为备言之，若病湿胜，湿气不得施化，致大小便不通，则宜用之耳，湿去则气得周流，所谓五脏有邪，更相平也。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-d9qes6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-d9qes6k","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《汤液本草》：牵牛，以气药引则入气，以大黄引则入血。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-2pu523u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-2pu523u","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《纲目》：牵牛，自宋以后，北人常用取快，及刘守真、张子和出，又倡为通用下药，李明之目击其事，故着其说极力？之。牵牛治水气在肺，喘满肿胀，下焦郁遏，腰背胀肿，及大肠风秘气秘，卓有殊功。但病在血分及脾胃虚弱而痞满者，则不可取快一时及常服，暗伤元气也。一宗室夫人，年几六十，平生苦肠结病，旬日一行，甚于生产，服养血润燥药则泥膈不快，服硝、黄通利药则若罔知，如此三十余年矣，时珍诊其人体肥，膏梁而多优郁，日吐酸痰碗许乃宽，又多火病，此乃三焦之气壅滞，有升无降，津液皆化为痰饮，不能下滋肠腑，非血燥比也。润剂留滞，硝、黄徒入血分，不能通气，俱为痰阻，故无效也。乃用牵牛末，皂荚膏丸与服，即便通利，自是但觉肠结，一服就顺，亦不妨食，且复精爽。盖牵牛能走气分，通三焦，气顺则痰逐饮消，上下通快矣，外甥柳乔，素多酒色，病下极胀痛，二便不通，不能坐卧，立哭呻吟者七昼夜。医用通利药不效，遣人叩予，予思此乃湿热之邪在精道，壅胀隧路，病在二阴之间，故前阻小便，后阻大便，病不在大肠、膀胱也。乃用楝实、茴香。穿山甲诸药，入牵牛加倍，水煎服，一服而减，三服而平。牵牛能达右肾命门，走精隧，人所不知，惟东垣李明之知之，故明之治下焦阳虚，天真丹用牵牛以盐水炒黑，入佐沉香、杜仲、破故纸。官桂诸药，深得补泻兼施之妙，方见《医学发明》。又东垣治脾湿太过，通身浮肿，喘不得卧，腹如鼓，海金沙散，亦以牵牛为君，则东垣未尽弃牵牛不用，但贵施之得道耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-qhsuej2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-qhsuej2","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草正》：牵牛，古方多为散、丸，若用救急，亦可佐群药煎服，然大泄元气，凡虚弱之人须忌之。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-zy0chty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-zy0chty","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草正义》：牵牛，善泄湿热，通利水道，亦走大便，故《别录》谓其苦寒，至李氏东垣，以其兼有辛莶气味，遂谓是辛热雄烈。按，此物甚滑，通泄是其专长，试细嚼之，惟其皮稍有辛味，古今主治，皆用之于湿热气滞，实肿胀满，二便不通，则东垣以为辛热，张石顽和之，亦谓辛温，皆属不确，当以《别录》之苦寒为正。又莶气戟人喉舌，细味之亦在皮中，所谓有毒，盖即在此。古方中凡用末子，均称止用头末，正以其皮粘韧，不易细碎，只用头末，则弃其皮，而可无辛莶之毒，颇有意味可思。《别录》主治专破气分之壅滞，泄水湿之肿满，除风利便，固皆以实病言之，此药功用，固已包举无遗，甄权申之，则日治痃癣气块，利大小便，东垣谓除气分湿热，三焦壅结；濒湖谓逐痰饮，通大肠气秘、风秘、杀虫。亦皆主结滞壅塞立论。而甄权乃又谓除虚肿，则误矣。《日华本草》谓治腰痛，盖亦指湿热阻塞，腰脊不利之症，惟言之殊不分明，究属非是。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-ldp0ww5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-ldp0ww5","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《别录》：主下气，疗脚满水肿，除风毒，利小便。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-760neig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-760neig","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《药性论》：治痃癖气块，利大小便，除水气，虚肿。落胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-7k7eke0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-7k7eke0","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《日华子本草》：取腰痛，下冷脓，并一切气壅滞。李杲：除气分湿热，三焦壅结。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-j114r45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-j114r45","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《纲目》：逐痰消饮，通大肠气秘风秘，杀虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-fkakrv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-fkakrv7","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《江苏植药志》：适用于急性关节炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-kvchcy7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-kvchcy7","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《新疆中草药手册》：泻下，利尿，杀虫。治便秘，消化不良，肾炎水肿，小儿咽喉炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902102902-riay4l8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102902-riay4l8","updated":"20240902102939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902102906-wzieuch","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902102906-wzieuch","updated":"20240902102939"}},{"ID":"20240902102907-pezsi8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902102907-pezsi8w","updated":"20240902102939"}}]}